      "oversampling": 1,
      "category": 0,
      "description": "Demo synth voice for the YAMS scripts. Signal path: osc-1 (saw) -> flt-1 (LP) -> amp-1 -> out-1; env-1 -> amp-1.cv. lfo-1 (~5 Hz) is a shared script source (cable-free - read via the address lfo-1.out). mmx-1 carries 8 YAMS-scripted routings: (1) flt cutoff = lag(velocity,40ms); (2) osc detune = LFO vibrato whose depth mod_wheel opens via lerp; (3) amp level = lfo*env tremolo; (4) flt resonance = sin(phasor(3)*tau) wobble gated by a velocity ternary; (5) amp pan = phasor auto-pan widening over age via smoothstep; (6) lfo rate = sah(white(), clock) stepped randomness; (7) flt drive = slew-shaped LFO; (8) osc level = white() shimmer. lfo-2 is a dedicated vibrato LFO (-> osc-1.fm) whose depth is automated 0->1->0 (because the mod_wheel macro is not sequencer-automatable).",
      "allocation_mode": "Polyphonic",
      "stealing_strategy": "Oldest",
      "max_voices": 8,
      "velocity_amp_sensitivity": 1.0,
      "velocity_filter_sensitivity": 0.5,
      "patch": {
        "name": "YAMS Script Demo",
        "version": "1.0",
        "description": "Saw bass with a lowpass filter, built as a live showcase of YAMS scripts. The core tone is deliberately simple (osc-1 sawtooth -> flt-1 LP 600 Hz, res 0.3 -> amp-1, ADSR envelope for volume) so the modulation is what you hear. All motion comes from mmx-1's eight scripted slots, and they respond to playing: hard velocity opens the filter (slot 1, lag-smoothed) and boosts the resonance wobble (slot 4, velocity ternary); longer notes let the auto-pan (slot 5) and tremolo (slot 3) sweep. lfo-1 acts as a shared modulation engine for several scripts. Pitch instability/grit comes from white noise on the oscillator level (slot 8) and slew-shaped drive (slot 7), while sah (slot 6) jumps the LFO rate in random steps. The vibrato has its own LFO (lfo-2 -> osc FM) with automated depth. Edit any script via the fx button on its row to hear it shape the sound live.",
        "modules": [
          {
            "id": "osc-1",
            "type": "oscillator",
            "position": {
              "x": 32.0,
              "y": 32.0
            },
            "parameters": {
